                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="13446705" author="smolav" created="Sat, 1 Sep 2012 13:49:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Support for &apos;real&apos; and &apos;integer&apos; in ARFF parsing.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13446722" author="tdunning" created="Sat, 1 Sep 2012 14:05:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I went ahead and committed this.  There are a few points, however.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;First trailing whitespace is a nono.  I removed the instances of this that I saw.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Secondly, you didn&apos;t add any tests.  Before I resolve this, it would be good to see a test that demonstrates the new capability. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13446723" author="tdunning" created="Sat, 1 Sep 2012 14:06:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Oh... also, it is comment to start a commit message with the bug.  I fixed this as well in the process of cleaning up the whitespace.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13446748" author="hudson" created="Sat, 1 Sep 2012 16:04:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #1644 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1644/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1644/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1063&quot; title=&quot;ARFF parser does not support &amp;#39;integer&amp;#39; and &amp;#39;real&amp;#39; attribute types&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-1063&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-1063&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Integer and real attributes are handled just as any numeric attribute. (Revision 1379763)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;     Result = SUCCESS&lt;br/&gt;
tdunning : &lt;a href=&quot;http://svn.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/?root=Apache-SVN&amp;amp;view=rev&amp;amp;rev=1379763&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://svn.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/?root=Apache-SVN&amp;amp;view=rev&amp;amp;rev=1379763&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Files : &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;/mahout/trunk/integration/src/main/java/org/apache/mahout/utils/vectors/arff/ARFFType.java&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;/mahout/trunk/integration/src/main/java/org/apache/mahout/utils/vectors/arff/ARFFVectorIterable.java&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;/mahout/trunk/integration/src/main/java/org/apache/mahout/utils/vectors/arff/MapBackedARFFModel.java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="13446764" author="smolav" created="Sat, 1 Sep 2012 17:39:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thank you for taking care of this.&lt;br/&gt;
Here is the test case.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13446823" author="tdunning" created="Sat, 1 Sep 2012 22:32:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Committed the test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There were still some whitespace issues with this new patch.  Fixed those as it came.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13446832" author="hudson" created="Sun, 2 Sep 2012 00:09:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #1646 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1646/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/1646/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
